  "schema": 1,
  "note": "Cross-stack EIP-712 vectors. Rust, Solidity and TypeScript must all agree with this file byte for byte. Every section names what confirmed it (ADR-0015): the x402 values were read off the deployed escrow and reproduced by the official SDK, while PositionReceipt and MarketId are ours and nothing external has an opinion on them. A confirmed digest proves an encoding of the input it was given, never that the input was right, so the roles are asserted by name too (CLAUDE.md section 5).",
