      "@x402/evm": "2.27.0"
    },
    "versions_note": "Recorded because `just vectors` only proves the file matches the generator. A dependency bump moves both together, so agents/test/vectors.test.ts asserts these equal the installed tree (ADR-0015).",
    "signers": "anvil accounts 0 (operator) and 1 (agent). Public test material; no key is written here."
  },
